
### Обычный запрос
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/calculate/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "numbers": [5, 3, 10],
  "delays": [1, 2, 0.5]
}

### Одинаковые задержки
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/calculate/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "numbers": [2, 4, 6],
  "delays": [1, 1, 1]
}

### Разное количество чисел и задержек
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/calculate/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "numbers": [5, 10],
  "delays": [1]
}


### Отрицательная задержка
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/calculate/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "numbers": [5],
    "delays" : [-1]
}

### Неверный тип данных
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/calculate/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "numbers": ["hello", 5],
    "delays": [1, 4]
}

### Слишком большой delay
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/calculate/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "numbers": [6, 5],
    "delays": [1000000000000000000000000000000000000000000000000000000, 4]
}

### Пустые входные данные
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/calculate/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "numbers": [],
    "delays": []
}